{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20846","headline":"河南府试十二月乐词 七月 · 李贺","name":"河南府试十二月乐词 七月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"星依云渚冷，露滴盘中圆。\n好花生木末，衰蕙愁空园。\n夜天如玉砌，池叶极青钱。\n仅厌舞衫薄，稍知花簟寒。\n晓风何拂拂，北斗光阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}